title: find:open
tags: [[GUI command]] [[Find in a panel]]
kind: reference
summary: Find text in the focused panel (optional text)

Opens the find bar and gives it the keyboard; when the bar is already open, goes back to it and selects its content. With a text, searches for that text at once — which is how a script drives the bar; without one, the last search comes back. See [[Find in a panel]].
